ternal_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:00-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421260\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2211\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-spanish-lit-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:00-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421260\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2221\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-spanish-lang-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:00-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421260\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2276\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-spanish-lang-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:54-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421314\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2271\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-spanish-lang-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe AP Spanish Language and Culture Exam has 2 sections and lasts approximately 2 hours and 30 minutes.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection I: Free Response\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe free-response section of the AP Spanish Language and Culture Exam includes 3 free-response questions and lasts approximately 1 hour and 10 minutes.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch3\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection I, Part A:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E \\u003Cstrong\\u003ESpeaking\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h3\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThis part of the exam includes 2 questions about your project. The part lasts approximately 15 minutes.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch3\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection I, Part B:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E \\u003Cstrong\\u003EWriting\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h3\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThis part of the exam includes one free-response question and lasts 55 minutes. During this time, you will review written and audio source materials and write the Argumentative Essay.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection II: Multiple Choice\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe multiple-choice section of the exam includes 2 parts and lasts approximately 1 hour and 20 minutes.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch3\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection II, Part A:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E \\u003Cstrong\\u003EListening\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h3\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThis part of the exam includes 5 question sets, each containing 5 multiple-choice questions, and lasts approximately 40 minutes. Each set includes an audio source that you will use to answer the questions. Once timing for each set expires, you will automatically move on to the next set, and you will be unable to return to the prior set.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch3\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection II, Part B:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E \\u003Cstrong\\u003EReading\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/h3\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThis part of the exam includes 6 question sets, each containing 5 multiple-choice questions, and lasts approximately 40 minutes. Each set includes reading material that you will use to answer the questions. Once time expires in this part, all the answers you have already selected will be automatically submitted, and you will be unable to return to the questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003ESource materials may have been edited for the purpose of this exam.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe inclusion of source material in this exam is not intended as an endorsement by College Board of the content, ideas, or values expressed in the material. The sources that appear in the AP Spanish Language and Culture Exam represent a range of different works, as appropriate for measuring the college-level knowledge and skills that are the focus of this course. AP students are not expected or asked to subscribe to any specific cultural or political values, but they are expected to analyze perspectives that may be different from their own and to analyze and interpret sources in their disciplinary contexts.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-07-13T10:29:55-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1783952995\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2266\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-networking-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the AP Networking Exam consists of a multiple-choice section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMultiple Choice\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThis section has 36 questions and lasts 1 hour. This section represents 50% of your total score. Your score on this section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou can go back and forth between questions in the section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes remain\\u2014\\u003Cem\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any time updates or warnings\\u003C\\/em\\u003E. Once time expires in the section, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EA calculator is available in this application and can be accessed throughout the exam.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be given for responses entered in this application. Any text you enter as an annotation will \\u003Cem\\u003Enot\\u003C\\/em\\u003E be included in your answer submissions. When time expires in the section, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:54-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421314\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2281\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-networking-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the AP Networking Exam consists of a multiple-choice section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMultiple Choice\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThis section has 36 questions and lasts 1 hour. This section represents 50% of your total score. Your score on this section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou can go back and forth between questions in the section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes remain\\u2014\\u003Cem\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any time updates or warnings\\u003C\\/em\\u003E. Once time expires in the section, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EA calculator is available in this application and can be accessed throughout the exam.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be given for responses entered in this application. Any text you enter as an annotation will \\u003Cem\\u003Enot\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Ebe included in your answer submissions. When time expires in the section, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:54-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421314\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2261\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-networking-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe AP Networking Exam has 2 multiple-choice sections and lasts 2 hours.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection I: Multiple Choice\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe first multiple-choice section has 36 questions and lasts 1 hour. This section represents 50% of your total score. Your score on this section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection II: Multiple Choice\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe second multiple-choice section has 36 questions and lasts 1 hour. This section represents 50% of your total score. Your score on this section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EEach section is timed separately. You can go back and forth between questions in a section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes remain in the section\\u2014\\u003Cem\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any time updates or warnings\\u003C\\/em\\u003E. You cannot move ahead to a different section. Once time expires in a section, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EA calculator is available in this application and can be accessed throughout the exam.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be given for responses entered in this application. Any text you enter as an annotation will \\u003Cem\\u003Enot\\u003C\\/em\\u003E be included in your answer submissions. When time expires in a section, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:01:54-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421314\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2251\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-cybersecurity-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 2 of the\\u0026nbsp;AP\\u0026nbsp;Cybersecurity\\u0026nbsp;Exam consists of the multiple-choice section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMultiple Choice\\u0026nbsp; \\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe multiple-choice section has 60 questions and lasts 1 hour and 20 minutes. This section\\u0026nbsp;represents\\