03E. You cannot move ahead to a different section. Once time expires in a section, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EA calculator and reference information, including lists of equations, are available in this application and can be accessed throughout the exam.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use the available paper for scratch work, but credit for Section I: Multiple Choice will only be given for responses entered in this application. When time expires in a section, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EFor Section II: Free Response, the questions are in this application, but you must write your responses to the questions in the free-response booklet. Use a pencil or pen with black or dark blue ink. You may use the available paper for scratch work, but credit will only be given for responses that are written in the free-response booklet.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:02:39-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421359\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2296\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-phys-2-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 2 of the AP Physics 2 Exam consists of the multiple-choice section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMultiple Choice\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe multiple-choice section has 40 questions and lasts 1 hour and 20 minutes. This section represents 50% of your total score. Your score on the multiple-choice section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou can go back and forth between questions in the section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes remain\\u2014\\u003Cstrong\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any time updates or warnings\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E. Once time expires in the section, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EA calculator and reference information, including lists of equations, are available in this application and can be accessed throughout the exam.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be given for responses entered in this application. When time expires in the section, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p2\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:02:39-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421359\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2316\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-ap-phys-2-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\