turn to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2781\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part1-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWithin the section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2771\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe SAT with Essay has three sections: Reading and Writing, Math, and the Essay.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 3: Essay\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere is one module in the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2756\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-math-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EToday you\\u0027ll be taking the Math section of the SAT,\\u0026nbsp; PSAT 10, or the PSAT 8\\/9.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in the module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from the first module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2761\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-math-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EToday you\\u0027ll be taking the Math section of the SAT,\\u0026nbsp; PSAT 10, or the PSAT 8\\/9.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in the module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from the first module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2766\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-day2-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2741\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EReading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-day1-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2786\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe digital SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, and PSAT 8\\/9 each consist of a Reading and Writing section and a Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2746\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-day2-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2751\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of a Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EReading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-day1-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2776\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe digital SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, and PSAT 8\\/9 each consist of a Reading and Writing section and a Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"College Board\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2086\",\"internal_id\":\"tools-video-transcript-audio\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Testing Tools\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cem\\u003EBegin audio description of Bluebook Testing Tools\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection Directions:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Directions are on the top left of each test screen. Find the show directions button in the exam player controls section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ETesting Timer: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EUse the timer to pace yourself. You can hide it until 5 minutes remain. The hide\\/show buttons are in the timer section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EHighlights \\u0026amp; Notes:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Click Highlights \\u0026amp; Notes then select some text to get started. The Highlights \\u0026amp; Notes button is in the test tools section. When activated, you can highlight text within the exam and create notes from the Highlight Options group of controls.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ELine Reader:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Use the line reader to help you focus as you\\u2019re reading test content. Access the line reader from the More options region within the test tools section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ECalculator: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EOn the SAT Suite of Assessments and certain AP Exams, you\\u2019ll have access to a calculator. Some exams have more than one kind. The calculator and reference buttons are located in the test tools section. When activated, a region for the calculator or reference sheets is opened.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EReference Sheet: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EMany exams have a reference sheet where you can find common formulas.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EHelp: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EClick on More to access Help content. Access the More button and expanded options from the test tools section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EExpand Left\\/Right: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EGrab the center line to expand either side of the screen. The separator control to expand the left and right panels is named \\u0022resize page content\\u0022 and located between the passage and question regions of the page.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EZoom: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EZoom with keyboard shortcuts on laptops or by pinching on tablets. Quick Tip: Zoom using Control +\\/- (PC) or Command +\\/- (Mac).\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EMark for Review: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EUse the bookmark icon to flag any question you want to come back to. The mark for review button is located in the Question and Answer section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EOption Eliminator: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EOn multiple-choice questions, if you think an answer option is wrong, you can cross it out. The option eliminator push button is located in the Question and Answer section. When pressed, buttons to cross out or undo crossed-out options appear adjacent to each answer option.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EQuestion Menu: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003ENavigate to any question in the section. The question navigator button is in the Question navigation section. When expanded, the book mark icon will appear in the question navigator to indicate questions that have been marked for review.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cem\\u003EEnd audio description of Bluebook Testing Tools\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-03-25T16:53:36-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1774472016\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2081\",\"internal_id\":\"setup-xtra-terms-conds-SAT-weekend\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Reminder: Biometric Data for Test Security\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWhen registering for the SAT\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Eand selecting this test center outside of the United States, you provided your explicit consent to the collection and processing of your biometric data, including your facial image for facial recognition and keystroke data.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003ECollege Board may collect this biometric data to:\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Econfirm the test taker is and remains the registered test taker\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Edetect and prevent fraud and misrepresentation\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Emaintain the integrity of the testing process\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Eimprove test security\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Edetect and prevent misconduct and violations of SAT Testing Rules\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Eprocess as permitted by law\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003C\\/ul\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003ECollege Board takes the privacy of our test takers seriously and protects your personal data with operational, administrative, technical,\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Eand physical security safeguards. You can review our full Privacy Statement and the Testing Rules at: \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eprivacy.collegeboard.org.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EIf you wish to withdraw your consent to the collection and processing of your biometric data, please do not continue with the test and notify the test administrator now. You will not be able to take the\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003ESAT today, and the test administrator will provide you with College Board\\u2019s Customer Service contact information.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-05-22T11:49:00-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1779464940\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1891\",\"internal_id\":\"kiosk-mode-config-error-chromebook\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Kiosk Mode Config Error Chromebook\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"Appears as a system check error and additionally in a login banner, on Chromebook, if the kiosk mode verification fails with an \\u0026quot;incorrect configuration\\u0026quot; error.\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan\\u003EYou cannot test with this device. Please contact the technology coordinator at your school.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E(Error code: LD2B)\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"title\":\"Verified Mode Is Not Configured Correctly\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT Weekend\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-08-14T16:06:52-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1786738012\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1941\",\"internal_id\":\"test-card-sat-wkd-no-test-center\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Card SAT W no test center\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022cb-red1-color\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EYour test center is closed.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003EPlease check your email for more information.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"},[]],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT Weekend\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1901\",\"internal_id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Get Your Desk Ready\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EYour proctor will collect these items:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cspan\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EA smartwatch, smartphone, smart glasses\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E, or any other connected device.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-smartwatch\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ENotes, books, or any other reference materials.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-notes\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EOther devices. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EAny camera, recording device, or timer.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-phone\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p3\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:12:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767715925\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1951\",\"internal_id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Get Your Desk Ready\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPut these items under your desk:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPower cord\\/portable charger. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EBut if you need to plug in during testing, you may.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-power-cord\",\"id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EBluetooth-enabled headphones or earbuds\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-earbuds\"