s\\u003C\\/em\\u003E. You cannot move ahead to a different section or part. Once time expires in a section or part, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be given for responses entered in this application. Any text you enter as an annotation will\\u003Cem\\u003E not\\u003C\\/em\\u003E be included in your answer submissions. When time expires in a section or part, all answers you have already entered will be submitted.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003ESource materials may have been edited for the purpose of this exam.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe inclusion of source material in this exam is not intended as an endorsement by College Board of the content, ideas, or values expressed in the material. The sources that appear in the AP United States History Exam represent a range of different authors, historical periods, and perspectives, as appropriate for measuring the college-level knowledge and skills that are the focus of this course. AP students are not expected or asked to subscribe to any specific cultural or political values, but they are expected to analyze perspectives that may be different from their own and to analyze and interpret sources in historical context.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-us-hist-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:09:58-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421798\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2726\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou should work on your essay until time expires, then your work will be submitted automatically.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EDirections for answering the essay can be found at the top-left corner of the question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2731\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Reading and Writing and Math sections.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2706\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-multiday-part3-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 3 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 3 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou should work on your essay until time expires, then your work will be submitted automatically.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EDirections for answering the essay can be found at the top-left corner of the question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2716\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-multiday-part2-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin the section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2696\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-multiday-part1-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWithin the section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2701\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe SAT with Essay has three sections: Reading and Writing, Math, and the Essay.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 3: Essay\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere is one module in the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2691\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EYou should work on your essay until time expires, then your work will be submitted automatically.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EDirections for answering the essay can be found at the top-left corner of the question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2736\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Reading and Writing and Math sections.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2721\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part3-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 3 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 3 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou should work on your essay until time expires, then your work will be submitted automatically.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the essay can be found at the top-left corner of the question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2711\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part2-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWithin the section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:11:47-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421907\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2781\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-multiday-part1-of-3\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT with Essay consists of the Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWithin the section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2771\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-essay-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe SAT with Essay has three sections: Reading and Writing, Math, and the Essay.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 3: Essay\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere is one module in the Essay section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2756\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-math-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EToday you\\u0027ll be taking the Math section of the SAT,\\u0026nbsp; PSAT 10, or the PSAT 8\\/9.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in the module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from the first module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2761\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-math-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EToday you\\u0027ll be taking the Math section of the SAT,\\u0026nbsp; PSAT 10, or the PSAT 8\\/9.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in the module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from the first module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2766\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-day2-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2741\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EReading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-day1-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2786\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-linear-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe digital SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, and PSAT 8\\/9 each consist of a Reading and Writing section and a Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (66 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 33 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-linear-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2746\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-multiday-part2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 2 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of the Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMath (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-day2-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2751\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-multiday-part1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EDay 1 of the SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, or PSAT 8\\/9 consists of a Reading and Writing section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EReading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThe two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-day1-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2776\",\"internal_id\":\"overview-sat-adaptive-singleday\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThe digital SAT, PSAT\\/NMSQT, PSAT 10, and PSAT 8\\/9 each consist of a Reading and Writing section and a Math section.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 1: Reading and Writing (54 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Reading and Writing section. Each module has 27 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ESection 2: Math (44 Questions)\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EThere are two modules in the Math section. Each module has 22 questions.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EModules\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003EWithin each section, the two modules are timed separately. If time permits, you can review your answers in a given module. When the timer reaches zero, you will automatically move on. Once you move on from any module, you cannot return to it.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EDirections\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDirections for answering the questions appear at the start of each section. You can find these directions at the top-left corner of every question screen.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-overview-sat-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"College Board\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-06-25T17:13:03-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1782421983\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2086\",\"internal_id\":\"tools-video-transcript-audio\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Testing Tools\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cem\\u003EBegin audio description of Bluebook Testing Tools\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ESection Directions:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Directions are on the top left of each test screen. Find the show directions button in the exam player controls section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ETesting Timer: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EUse the timer to pace yourself. You can hide it until 5 minutes remain. The hide\\/show buttons are in the timer section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EHighlights \\u0026amp; Notes:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Click Highlights \\u0026amp; Notes then select some text to get started. The Highlights \\u0026amp; Notes button is in the test tools section. When activated, you can highlight text within the exam and create notes from the Highlight Options group of controls.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ELine Reader:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E Use the line reader to help you focus as you\\u2019re reading test content. Access the line reader from the More options region within the test tools section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ECalculator: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EOn the SAT Suite of Assessments and certain AP Exams, you\\u2019ll have access to a calculator. Some exams have more than one kind. The calculator and reference buttons are located in the test tools section. When activated, a region for the calculator or reference sheets is opened.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EReference Sheet: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EMany exams have a reference sheet where you can find common formulas.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EHelp: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EClick on More to access Help content. Access the More button and expanded options from the test tools section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EExpand Left\\/Right: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EGrab the center line to expand either side of the screen. The separator control to expand the left and right panels is named \\u0022resize page content\\u0022 and located between the passage and question regions of the page.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EZoom: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EZoom with keyboard shortcuts on laptops or by pinching on tablets. Quick Tip: Zoom using Control +\\/- (PC) or Command +\\/- (Mac).\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EMark for Review: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EUse the bookmark icon to flag any question you want to come back to. The mark for review button is located in the Question and Answer section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EOption Eliminator: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EOn multiple-choice questions, if you think an answer option is wrong, you can cross it out. The option eliminator push button is located in the Question and Answer section. When pressed, buttons to cross out or undo crossed-out options appear adjacent to each answer option.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EQuestion Menu: \\u003C\\/strong\\u003ENavigate to any question in the section. The question navigator button is in the Question navigation section. When expanded, the book mark icon will appear in the question navigator to indicate questions that have been marked for review.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cem\\u003EEnd audio description of Bluebook Testing Tools\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-03-25T16:53:36-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1774472016\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2081\",\"internal_id\":\"setup-xtra-terms-conds-SAT-weekend\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Reminder: Biometric Data for Test Security\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EWhen registering for the SAT\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Eand selecting this test center outside of the United States, you provided your explicit consent to the collection and processing of your biometric data, including your facial image for facial recognition and keystroke data.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003ECollege Board may collect this biometric data to:\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cul\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Econfirm the test taker is and remains the registered test taker\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Edetect and prevent fraud and misrepresentation\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Emaintain the integrity of the testing process\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Eimprove test security\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Edetect and prevent misconduct and violations of SAT Testing Rules\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003Cli\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022s1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003Eprocess as permitted by law\\u003C\\/li\\u003E\\u003C\\/ul\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003ECollege Board takes the privacy of our test takers seriously and protects your personal data with operational, administrative, technical,\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Eand physical security safeguards. You can review our full Privacy Statement and the Testing Rules at: \\u003Cstrong\\u003Eprivacy.collegeboard.org.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EIf you wish to withdraw your consent to the collection and processing of your biometric data, please do not continue with the test and notify the test administrator now. You will not be able to take the\\u003Cstrong\\u003E \\u003C\\/strong\\u003ESAT today, and the test administrator will provide you with College Board\\u2019s Customer Service contact information.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-05-22T11:49:00-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1779464940\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1891\",\"internal_id\":\"kiosk-mode-config-error-chromebook\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Kiosk Mode Config Error Chromebook\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"Appears as a system check error and additionally in a login banner, on Chromebook, if the kiosk mode verification fails with an \\u0026quot;incorrect configuration\\u0026quot; error.\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan\\u003EYou cannot test with this device. Please contact the technology coordinator at your school.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E(Error code: LD2B)\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"title\":\"Verified Mode Is Not Configured Correctly\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT Weekend\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-08-14T16:06:52-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1786738012\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1941\",\"internal_id\":\"test-card-sat-wkd-no-test-center\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Test Card SAT W no test center\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022cb-red1-color\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EYour test center is closed.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003EPlease check your email for more information.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"},[]],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"SAT Weekend\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1901\",\"internal_id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Get Your Desk Ready\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EYour proctor will collect these items:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cspan\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EA smartwatch, smartphone, smart glasses\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E, or any other connected device.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-smartwatch\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003ENotes, books, or any other reference materials.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-notes\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EOther devices. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EAny camera, recording device, or timer.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-phone\",\"id\":\"ready-proctor-ap-wl-mt-p3\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:12:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767715925\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1951\",\"internal_id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Get Your Desk Ready\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPut these items under your desk:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPower cord\\/portable charger. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EBut if you need to plug in during testing, you may.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-power-cord\",\"id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EBluetooth-enabled headphones or earbuds\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-earbuds\",\"id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EFree-response booklet. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EIf you\\u0027re taking a hybrid AP Exam, you\\u0027ll use this booklet for Section II.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-notes\",\"id\":\"ready-under-desk-ap-wl-mt-p3\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1966\",\"internal_id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Get Your Desk Ready\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPut these items on your desk:\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EYour testing device\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-laptop\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EPrinted reference sheet or any personal project materials \\u003C\\/strong\\u003Eyour exam may require.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-ref-sheet\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EWired headphones with a microphone\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-wired-headphones-mic\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p3\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EAn external mouse or keyboard. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EYou can use an external keyboard with a tablet\\u2014not with a laptop.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-mouse\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p4\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EA pencil or pen that uses blue or black ink\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-pencil-pen\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p5\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EThe scratch paper your proctor provided you. \\u003C\\/strong\\u003EWrite your full name and the name of this course at the top of each sheet.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-scratch-paper\",\"id\":\"ready-on-desk-ap-wl-mt-p6\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1886\",\"internal_id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-prohibited-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"PROHIBITED\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003ENotes, books, or any other reference materials.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-notes\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-prohibited-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EBluetooth-enabled headphones or earbuds.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-earbuds\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-prohibited-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003ESmart glasses, a smartphone, smartwatch, or any other connected device.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-smart-glasses\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-prohibited-ap-wl-mt-p3\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EAny camera, recording device, or timer.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-no-phone\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-prohibited-ap-wl-mt-p4\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-03-13T16:05:05-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1773432305\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1931\",\"internal_id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-allowed-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"ALLOWED\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EYou may use the scratch paper provided by your proctor. You may not bring your own scratch paper.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-scratch-paper\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-allowed-ap-wl-mt-p1\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1961\",\"internal_id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-required-ap-wl-mt\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"REQUIRED\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EThis device and its power cord.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-laptop\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-required-ap-wl-mt-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EWired headphones with a microphone.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-wired-headphones-mic\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-required-ap-wl-mt-p2\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EAny personal project materials your exam may require.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"icon\":\"ico-ref-sheet\",\"id\":\"setup-testdaychecklist-required-ap-wl-mt-p3\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716345\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1926\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-switch-keyboards\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Practice Switching Keyboards\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EPress \\u003Cstrong\\u003E{{CMD_KEYBOARD_SHORTCUT}}\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E to switch between English and foreign language keyboards\\u003Cstrong\\u003E.\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou can hold down keys for special characters, such as: \\u00e9, \\u00f1, \\u00bf\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-switch-keyboards-p1\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp lang=\\u0022es\\u0022\\u003E\\u00a1Me ir\\u00e1 muy bien en el examen de espa\\u00f1ol!\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-switch-keyboards-es\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EType Either \\u003C\\/strong\\u003E(Simplified):\\u0026nbsp;\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan lang=\\u0022zh\\u0022\\u003E\\u4eca\\u5929\\u7684\\u8003\\u8bd5\\u6211\\u4f1a\\u52a0\\u6cb9\\u7684\\uff01\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cstrong\\u003EOr \\u003C\\/strong\\u003E(Traditional):\\u0026nbsp;\\u003Cbr\\u003E\\u003Cspan lang=\\u0022zh\\u0022\\u003E\\u4eca\\u5929\\u7684\\u8003\\u8a66\\u6211\\u6703\\u52a0\\u6cb9\\u7684!\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-switch-keyboards-zh\"},{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EI\\u0027m going to do my best on today\\u0027s exam!\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\",\"id\":\"checkin-switch-keyboards-en\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-21T15:54:05-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1769028845\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1921\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-cybersecurity-day2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EDay 2 of the\\u0026nbsp;AP\\u0026nbsp;Cybersecurity\\u0026nbsp;Exam consists of the multiple-choice section.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003EMultiple Choice\\u0026nbsp; \\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThe multiple-choice section has 60 questions and lasts 1 hour and 20 minutes. This section\\u0026nbsp;represents\\u0026nbsp;66% of your total score. Your score on the multiple-choice section is based on the number of questions answered correctly. Points are not deducted for incorrect answers or unanswered questions.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp; \\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou can go back and forth between questions in the section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes\\u0026nbsp;remain\\u2014\\u003Cem\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any\\u0026nbsp;time\\u0026nbsp;updates or warnings\\u003C\\/em\\u003E. Once time expires in the section, you cannot\\u0026nbsp;return to\\u0026nbsp;it.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EYou may use scratch paper for notes and planning, but credit will only be\\u0026nbsp;given for\\u0026nbsp;responses entered in this application. Any text you enter as an annotation will\\u003Cem\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;not\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;be included in your answer submissions. When\\u0026nbsp;time\\u0026nbsp;expires in the section, all answers you have already entered will be\\u0026nbsp;submitted.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law.\\u202fNeither\\u0026nbsp;College\\u0026nbsp;Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:13:43-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716023\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1881\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-cybersecurity-day1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp class=\\u0022Paragraph SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003EDay 1 of the AP Cybersecurity Exam consists of the free-response section.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022EOP SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun EmptyTextRun SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003EFree Response\\u0026nbsp;\\u003Cstrong\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022EOP SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022Paragraph SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003EThe free-response section has 2 \\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003Equestions \\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003Eand\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003E lasts 40 minutes. This section represents 34% of your total score.\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022EOP SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Ch2\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight MacChromeBold SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003ETaking the Exam\\u0026nbsp;\\u003Cstrong\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/strong\\u003E\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022EOP SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/h2\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022Paragraph SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003EYou can go back and forth between questions in the section until time expires. The clock will turn red when 5 minutes remain\\u2014\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cem\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003Ethe proctor will not give you any \\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003Etime\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003E updates or warnings\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/em\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003E. Once time expires in the section, you cannot \\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003Ereturn to\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u0022EN-US\\u0022\\u003E it.\\u0026nbsp;\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022EOP SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u0026nbsp;\\u003C\\/span\\u003E\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022Paragraph SCXW65334460 BCX0\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Cspan class=\\u0022TextRun Highlight SCXW65334460 BCX0 NormalTextRun\\u0022 lang=\\u00