t expected or asked to subscribe to any specific cultural or political values, but they are expected to analyze and interpret sources in their disciplinary contexts.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\\u003Cp class=\\u0022p1\\u0022\\u003EThere may be references in AP testing materials to companies, products, and brands that are owned by others and subject to trademark law. Neither College Board nor the AP testing materials are affiliated with or endorsed by these trademark owners.\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-07-10T17:29:05-04:00\\u0022\\u003E1783718945\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"2001\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-japanese-day2\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 2 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:55-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716395\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1996\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-japanese-day1\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Day 1 Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"internal_description\":\"\",\"external_description\":\"\",\"overview\":\"\",\"content\":[{\"content\":\"\\u003Cp\\u003EContent is TK\\u003C\\/p\\u003E\"}],\"cancel_interaction\":[],\"confirm_interaction\":[],\"offering\":\"AP\",\"delivery_method\":\"\",\"changed\":\"\\u003Ctime datetime=\\u00222026-01-06T11:19:55-05:00\\u0022\\u003E1767716395\\u003C\\/time\\u003E\\n\"},{\"id\":\"1986\",\"internal_id\":\"checkin-overview-ap-japanese\",\"type\":\"functional_content\",\"title\":\"Exam Overview\",\"short_title\":\"\",\"alternate_title\":\"\",\"inte